  "title": "Unified 3D and Vision Synthesis Frameworks for Efficient Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "GeoWorld and VGGRPO introduce advanced 3D scene generation and dynamic scene modeling frameworks, while DreamOmni3, Hunyuan3D-Buffalo 1.0, and LaviGen enhance 3D generation capabilities with multimodal models. RealityBridge and FlowPainter focus on 3D reconstruction with diffusion-based methods. UniWorld-View and MetaView address view synthesis challenges with geometric and metric-based approaches.",
